# --- Secrets & local config ---
# Anything you don't want in a public AGPL repo goes here. Better still:
# keep it in a sibling private repo. See README "License & private state".
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
secrets/
credentials/
private/
notes/
local/
