# --- Workstream admin (private tooling; ephemeral, regenerated from Todoist) ---
# Personal task-mirror state — never belongs in this public AGPL repo. Recreatable:
# `todoist init --name "NYC Schools"` rebuilds .todoist-sync.json from the live project;
# TRACKER.md is regenerated by /todoist. Todoist itself is the durable store.
TRACKER.md
.todoist-sync.json
.goodnight.md

# --- Data cache (large; rebuilt by scripts/fetch_data.py) ---
school-data/

